<title>UK: St Ives buys Perlmuter for $35 million.</title>
<headline>St Ives buys Perlmuter for $35 million.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>St Ives Plc said it had bought The Perlmuter Printing Company for $35 million, the price to be met from existing resources and facilities.</p>
<p>Perlmuter is a commercial web and sheet-fed offset printer based in Cleveland, Ohio in the U.S.</p>
<p>It said Perlmuter had income before tax of $5.5 million and sales of $46 million in the year ending October 29, 1995.</p>
<p>Net assets at that date were $9.8 million after taking into account $13 million of external borrowings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
